title: "harnesswatch: security analysis and audit toolkit for AI coding-agent harnesses"
abstract: >-
  Security audit toolkit for AI coding-agent harnesses: static audits of
  harness configuration, MCP declarations, instruction files, secret residue,
  supply chain and CI; a black-box behavioural probe; and an inert canary
  prompt-injection benchmark.
